                { "book": "hero-of-ages", "chapter": "prologue" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "While training under Gemmel, Kelsier defeated the Mistborn Antillius Shezler and found his notes theorizing about an eleventh Allomantic metal. Sazed, looking back, found no older legends of it and concluded Ruin had fabricated them to drive Kelsier's plan, and Ruin claimed as much.",
          "revealedIn": [
            {
              "all": [
                { "book": "hero-of-ages", "chapter": "24" },
                "eleventh-metal",
                { "book": "secret-history", "chapter": "6-1" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kelsier claimed legends told of an Eleventh Metal that could let someone slay the Lord Ruler, and that he had found it.",
          "revealedIn": [
            {
              "all": [
                { "book": "final-empire", "chapter": "35" },
                { "book": "hero-of-ages", "chapter": "23" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vin burned the Eleventh Metal in Kredik Shaw but could not make sense of what it showed her. Burning it again as she charged the Lord Ruler, she struck at the shadowy figure it revealed, to no effect.",
          "revealedIn": [
            {
              "all": [
                { "book": "final-empire", "chapter": "38" },
                { "book": "hero-of-ages", "chapter": "prologue" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
